{%- comment -%}
  FAQ Page Template
  SEO-optimized with structured content
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="min-h-screen bg-black py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="container px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="display-heading mb-4 sm:mb-6 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-6xl">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-lg sm:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        Got questions? We've got answers. Everything you need to know about Big Butt Association, our products, shipping, and more.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      
      {%- comment -%} General Questions {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">General Questions</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What is Big Butt Association?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Big Butt Association (BBA) is a bold, irreverent EDM and festival clothing brand built around our mascot, Bekky the alpaca. We create high-quality jerseys, hoodies, tees, and accessories for the rave community. We're more than a brand—we're a movement celebrating confidence, self-expression, and the festival lifestyle.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Who is Bekky?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Bekky is our beloved alpaca mascot who represents the playful, confident energy of the BBA community. "Bekky with a big butt" has become a rallying cry for our fam, and you'll see her featured throughout our designs and branding.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What makes BBA different from other festival clothing brands?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We're not just selling clothes—we're building a community. Our designs are bold, our quality is top-tier, and our brand personality is unapologetically authentic. Plus, we have BekkyBucks, our loyalty program that rewards our BBA Fam with exclusive perks and discounts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Products & Sizing {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Products & Sizing</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What products do you sell?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We specialize in festival and EDM apparel including hockey jerseys, hoodies, t-shirts, and accessories. All designed with the rave community in mind, featuring bold graphics, neon accents, and premium materials.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">How do I know what size to order?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Check out our <a href="/pages/size-guide" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">Size Guide</a> for detailed measurements. Our sizing runs true to size for most items, but we recommend checking the specific product page for any size notes. When in doubt, size up for a more comfortable fit.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Do you offer custom designs or personalization?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Currently, we focus on our core collection, but we're always open to feedback from our BBA Fam. Follow us on social media for updates on new designs and potential custom options in the future.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Are your products unisex?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Yes! Most of our products are designed to be unisex and comfortable for all body types. Our sizing charts include measurements to help you find the perfect fit regardless of gender.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Orders & Shipping {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Orders & Shipping</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Where do you ship?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We currently ship to the United States, Canada, and Mexico. International shipping beyond these regions is not available at this time. For detailed shipping information, check our <a href="/pages/shipping-returns" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">Shipping & Returns</a> page.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">How long does shipping take?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Standard shipping typically takes 5-7 business days within the US, and 7-14 business days for Canada and Mexico. Processing time is 1-3 business days. During peak seasons or sales, processing may take longer. You'll receive a tracking number once your order ships.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Can I track my order?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Absolutely! Once your order ships, you'll receive an email with a tracking number. You can also track your order by logging into your account on our site.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What if my order is wrong or damaged?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We're sorry that happened! Contact us immediately at <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">BigButtAssociation@gmail.com</a> with your order number and photos of the issue. We'll make it right with a replacement or refund.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Returns & Exchanges {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Returns & Exchanges</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What's your return policy?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We accept returns within 30 days of delivery for unworn, unwashed items with tags attached. Items must be in original condition. For full details, visit our <a href="/pages/shipping-returns" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">Shipping & Returns</a> page.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Do you offer exchanges?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Yes! If you need a different size, we can process an exchange. Contact us at <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">BigButtAssociation@gmail.com</a> with your order number and desired size. Exchanges are subject to availability.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">Are sale items returnable?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Sale and clearance items are typically final sale unless defective. Check the product page for specific return eligibility.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Membership & BekkyBucks {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Membership & BekkyBucks</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What is BekkyBucks?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              BekkyBucks is our loyalty rewards program! Earn points on every purchase, get exclusive discounts, early access to new drops, and special perks reserved for our BBA Fam. The more you shop, the more you earn.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">How do I join the BBA Fam?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Creating an account automatically enrolls you in BekkyBucks! Just sign up when you make your first purchase, or create an account on our <a href="/pages/members" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">Members</a> page. It's free and you'll start earning rewards immediately.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">How do I check my BekkyBucks balance?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              Log into your account and visit your dashboard. You'll see your current BekkyBucks balance, purchase history, and available rewards. You can also check via the Joy widget if you're logged in.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Model Program {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-purple-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 font-heading">Model Program</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">How do I become a BBA model?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We're always looking for passionate members of the BBA Fam to represent our brand! Fill out our <a href="/pages/model-application" class="neon-text-purple hover:text-bekky-gold-neon transition-colors">Model Application</a> form. No pro photos required—we care more about your energy, alignment with our values, and authentic connection to the brand.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-xl mb-3 font-heading">What are the requirements to be a BBA model?</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed">
              We're looking for people who genuinely connect with BBA's mission and culture. You should be 18+, comfortable in festival/nightlife environments, and excited to represent the brand authentically. Social media following is a plus but not required.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Still Have Questions {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="neon-card bg-bekky-purple-neon/10 border-2 border-bekky-purple-neon">
        <h2 class="text-bekky-gold-neon text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-4 font-heading text-center">Still Have Questions?</h2>
        <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-center leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Can't find what you're looking for? We're here to help! Reach out to us directly.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center">
          <a href="mailto:BigButtAssociation@gmail.com" class="neon-button-purple neon-button-lg inline-block">
            Contact Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%} FAQ Schema for SEO {%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is Big Butt Association?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Big Butt Association (BBA) is a bold, irreverent EDM and festival clothing brand built around our mascot, Bekky the alpaca. We create high-quality jerseys, hoodies, tees, and accessories for the rave community."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Where do you ship?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We currently ship to the United States, Canada, and Mexico. International shipping beyond these regions is not available at this time."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is BekkyBucks?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "BekkyBucks is our loyalty rewards program! Earn points on every purchase, get exclusive discounts, early access to new drops, and special perks reserved for our BBA Fam."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

